# --- Inngest (background jobs: document extraction, AI analysis, graph build) ---
# Leave unset for local dev — the Inngest Dev Server auto-discovers
# http://localhost:3000/api/inngest with no keys required.
# INNGEST_EVENT_KEY=
# INNGEST_SIGNING_KEY=

# --- LLM providers (AI Case Analyzer — Day 4) ---
# Fallback chain, tried in this order: Groq → Cerebras → OpenRouter → Hugging
# Face Inference Providers. Only providers with a key set are used — set at
# least one. All are free-tier-friendly for a zero-cost MVP.
GROQ_API_KEY=
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
HF_API_KEY=

# Optional — override the default model used per provider.
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
# CEREBRAS_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free
# HF_MODEL=meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct
